  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nAn alien has kidnapped Matt Damon, not knowing what lengths humanity goes through to retrieve him whenever he goes missing. The aliens are determined to figure out what makes Matt Damon so special that thousands of people would risk their lives to get him back. They begin running tests on him. Is it a biological thing? No, it's not. They then begin to realize it's just a boyish charm, something they can't themselves have. So they come up with a plan to clone him, but unfortunately for them the cloning machine malfunctions.\n\nThey get a bunch of clones of Matt Damon. However, none of them have the same charm. They are just like an every day, average guy.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 26,
  "reference_text": " Apparently you can't replicate Matt Damon's one of a kind quality. So the aliens have no choice but to keep all of these clones locked in a cage. They know that people from Earth will soon show up to rescue him. They begin trying to find the clone that is the closest to the real Matt Damon.",
